:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Li'l Jamiera Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Titan Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] improves health, damage and attack rate and gains a chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metals]], but recharges slower. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

